# Change & Release Checklist

## Every code change
- `CHANGELOG.md` — add entry under `[Unreleased]`
- `docs/phase-status.md` — update if the change advances/closes a v2 phase checkpoint
- `README.md` Roadmap section — update if a phase ships or a new phase opens
- Add/update tests for changed behavior

There is intentionally no `TODO.md`. See `AGENTS.md` for the full
source-of-truth file list.

## Version bump (before tagging)
- `Cargo.toml` — `version`
- `python/pyproject.toml` — `version`
- `CHANGELOG.md` — move `[Unreleased]` to new `[x.y.z]` section, update compare links
- `Dockerfile` — `org.opencontainers.image.version` label
- Tag: `git tag v0.x.y && git push origin v0.x.y` (triggers crates.io + PyPI + GHCR publish)
